WEBVTT

00:02:58.141 --> 00:03:01.325
with what I'm making
to take care of my basic needs?

00:03:01.349 --> 00:03:04.075
And if not, what adjustments
do I need to make?

00:03:04.099 --> 00:03:07.742
And then we start to break it down
and talk about the tools.

00:03:07.766 --> 00:03:10.909
We start to say, "Do we have
our savings account, auto-save?"

00:03:10.933 --> 00:03:14.034
Set it and forget it,
or every day, put a dollar a day.

00:03:14.058 --> 00:03:16.200
Whatever that rhythm is for you,

00:03:16.224 --> 00:03:18.409
the goal is the rhythm, not the amount.

00:03:18.433 --> 00:03:19.909
You can start slow.

00:03:19.933 --> 00:03:23.284
You can start small,
but you have to start now.

00:03:23.308 --> 00:03:26.242
And then let me give you a trick,
we all have impulses.

00:03:26.266 --> 00:03:28.534
Many times, because
the phone is always with us,

00:03:28.558 --> 00:03:29.825
we start shopping.

00:03:29.849 --> 00:03:32.200
Go out to any site,
shop up, put it in your cart.